  // Wave 2 — made things, formless things, and growing things.
  //
  // Moveset rules: see `humanoids.json`'s header.
  //
  // The golems are the clearest case in the whole enemy set for why families are physiological
  // rather than nominal: an Ice Golem and a Magma Golem are the same construct body with
  // different moves. Splitting them into families would have duplicated an entire stat block to
  // express one spell.

